# UI theme

- Tokens only (`--color-canvas`, `--color-surface`, `--color-accent`, …) — see `docs/ui-theme.md`.
- Swap token maps to retheme; do not rewrite feature pages.
- Ops screens: tables/inboxes — avoid purple gradients, loud glass, decorative card stacks.
